Spring is the first season of the year as well as the first season of the game. It's preceded by [[Winter]] and followed by [[Summer]].

Most of the Stardew Valley Expanded NPCs will attend all of the vanilla spring festivals - the [[Stardew:Egg Festival|Egg Festival]] on Spring 13, the [[Stardew:Desert Festival|Desert Festival]] on Spring 15 - 17, and the [[Stardew:Flower Dance|Flower Dance]] on Spring 24.

